Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.63,0:00:19.46,Staccato 555 BT,,0,0,0,,{\fs112\an8}HEAVENWARD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, look at how strong you've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's take this monster down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Mira, I'm going to save you!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.58,0:00:56.25,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}My heart sunk and I no longer feel hope for the future
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.50,0:01:01.17,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}It felt like time froze and now it's all over
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.67,0:01:04.04,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Brooding and silent
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.04,0:01:07.71,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}The umbrella of my heart began to open
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.71,0:01:11.04,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Still, I kept my chin up and went on
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.63,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I won't ask you to comfort me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.96,0:01:20.83,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I want to grow strong and focus on what's ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.83,0:01:27.00,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}But weakness crushes me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.67,0:01:33.67,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Meeting you is what filled my world with light
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.67,0:01:38.54,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I didn't have an ounce of hope, and yet I could laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.54,0:01:43.13,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Ordinary conversations always brought me a smile
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.33,0:01:47.04,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I won't say thanks 'cause you'll blush and laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}But I'm thinking it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.58,0:01:52.63,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Can I move forward from here?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.63,0:01:53.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}O light, come to me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.50,0:02:11.96,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(307.2,140.4)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.50,0:02:11.96,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\fs87\an8}Slave: Heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A trump card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's our turn! Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slay support first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using chains? Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what happens when\Nyou get caught in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not ordinary chains then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coco, now on, I'll save you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're already defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki! Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My angry cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stopped my attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter, a god's wrath\Nwill always be felt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one attack after the other!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting old!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep drawing them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of the Ozymas,\Nwe will hold the line!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.17,0:04:41.58,Staccato 555 BT,,0,0,0,,{\fs112\an8}HEAVENWARD
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.58,0:04:45.96,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\fs51\an8}(TENKA)\N{\fs112}HEAVENLY FLOWER
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.59,0:04:45.96,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\fs51\an8}(TENSHIN)\N{\fs112}HEAVENWARD
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to live up to the\Nfeelings he has put forth today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peaks of clouds above.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many sink to lay bare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moonlit mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unshackle my mind of its limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My movements will be enhanced\Nfor a short amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I developed this attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To defeat the eight thunder gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the true might of a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.88,0:05:47.75,Staccato 555 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(153.6,86.4)\fs112}MILLIONFOLD
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.88,0:05:47.75,Staccato 555 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs112\pos(153.6,367.2)}DIVINE
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.88,0:05:47.75,Staccato 555 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs112\pos(153.6,637.2)}PUNISHMENTS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breathtaking majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's only cloning her arms. Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tremble in terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before my million-fold divine punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See it in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They broke through my multi-attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A meaningless hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll push harder with the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:07:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be on the safe side, I'll send my\Nclones to deliver the final blow. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out there and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mira!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your clones are slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you haven't\Nabsorbed Mira completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's end this! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.82,0:08:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Mira!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.88,0:08:06.46,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}When I gently opened my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be fully assimilated before long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am formidable!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.79,0:08:11.88,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I was shrouded in darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a god!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.63,0:08:17.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}One... then another... I bore the sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pledge myself fully.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.88,0:08:20.29,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Through falling tears
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Miss Kyouka.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.25,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}And I vowed to hold onto hope
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki's banished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki's.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.46,0:08:37.08,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I always had this dream
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside her sword.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.33,0:08:42.67,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}One so very far out of reach
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.29,0:08:47.83,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}It has to come true, that what I wished
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.58,0:08:53.00,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}That was the moment you and I connected
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accept your fate from\Nan all-powerful time!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}"Always be positive"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.38,0:08:58.29,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}"Always be true"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.29,0:09:02.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}If I'm with you, everything will be okay
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.75,0:09:08.21,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I will turn this world into a garden of light
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sword of servitude!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.67,0:09:05.71,Freehand471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs99\pos(268.8,442.8)}SWORD OF
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.67,0:09:05.71,Freehand471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs99\pos(192.0,540.0)}SUBJUGATION
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.21,0:09:15.25,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I swear I'll do it, I'll lead us to the future
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This launches me from inside her sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using one of my lethal strikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll combine my heavenward power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my martial arts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate dual technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you attempt to resist capture\Nor try to escape, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this her default form?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist on trying to kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to bow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavenward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. What about\Nmy sister and her friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move or I'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like she got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you conquered a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relay the news of our enemy's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll secure the perimeter so\Neverything is safe. Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll write the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the healing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of energy left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Miss Tovera here, we'll\Nbe back on our feet in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finally breathe, but why\Ndo I feel like I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uhhh... Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuusetsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this is actually real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your dream state.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mind palace of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all inside my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost my physical form, so I had to\Nmanifest what traces of my energy remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drank my divine\Nnectar, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing about gods is, they\Ndon't vanish into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My physical form is gone now,\Nand this is all that remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for me to affect\Nthe outside world, much less fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you and I are left with no\Nother choice but to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to wake up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can chat whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should feel lucky having such a\Nbeautiful god living inside you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I feel so lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the 7th Squadron dorm! You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that whole\Nthing was just a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear that was real, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You calm down right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost consciousness after\Nthe battle in Yokohama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been asleep for about two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they brought me back\Nto headquarters to rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wounds have healed nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in perfect health!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's at HQ,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the commander is discussing\Neverything that happened back in Yokohama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I should also be\Nhelping and get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today you're going to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nei will handle all the cooking,\Nand you might want to take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.74,0:15:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and take Nei up on\Nher offer and freshen up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd be awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body is starting to move on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:16:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyoka hasn't given me my reward yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling pretty great myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say you're the one who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This victory was earned\Nby all the defense force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting back even after being consumed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were stubborn as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought of letting her absorb\Nall of my power got me so pissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing since we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can lend me a hand\Nwith the debriefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mira.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The debriefing will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more important?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His reward is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to reward him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you said, this victory\Nbelongs to the Demon Defense Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who are able to reward him should!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.21,0:17:09.13,AdLib BT,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\an7\c&Hc080ff&\pos(326.4,86.4)}Squeeze
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.13,AdLib BT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1440.0,151.2)\an7\fs63\c&Hc080ff&}Squeeze
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.38,0:17:09.13,AdLib BT,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\an7\pos(153.6,691.2)\c&Hc080ff&}Squee
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that truly the issue here?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.13,AdLib BT,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\an7\pos(1516.8,691.2)\c&Hc080ff&}eeeze
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did go out of his way\Nto rescue me himself, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help with the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit pressuring yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, it seems\Nlike we'll be taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even share a charnel!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.63,0:17:30.88,AdLib BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&Hc080ff&\pos(153.6,442.8)}Tremble
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.63,0:17:30.88,AdLib BT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1497.6,518.4)\c&Hc080ff&}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Tenka?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body isn't moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you not losing\Nyour mind about this?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.92,0:17:39.63,Attic,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\an7\pos(691.2,788.4)}TURMOIL
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get undressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was the one who suggested it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous I'm\Nparalyzed are you starting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to feel dizzy i think\Nyou may be a little shy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing stuff like this in\Na hot spring you pervert
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did so great out there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that\Nyou should really know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A god living on inside of Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:18:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds harmless enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's difficult to tell\Nwhether it was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even talk to her right now anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to always watch out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see how it all plays out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Report anything unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.50,0:19:31.08,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Next Day
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in anticipation of the\Neight thunder gods next
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack, Kyouka and Mira\Nheld a post-mortem after.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle with Kuusetsu,\Nthey focused on Mira's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loss carefully reflecting\Non what factors caused
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yep in the end i shouldn't have come\Nat her head on only because you had to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,save all of those innocent people as\Na commander i wish i could have taken
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down a god everything turned out fine\Nin the end though and i refuse to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,settle for less as talented as miss\Nmira is she's extremely hard on herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyouka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to borrow Yukki.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.79,0:20:33.08,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Love beam!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.25,0:20:46.92,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Wanna know and wanna do, wanna touch
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.92,0:20:52.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}These feelings pouring out of me just won't stop
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.75,0:20:59.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Sweet, so sweet, let me in with your body darling
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.38,0:21:02.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}I'll domesticate you, time for a reward
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.96,0:21:07.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}With the heat from skin on skin overlapping
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.71,0:21:10.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}It's fully charged
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.71,0:21:12.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Now ready to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.96,0:21:16.08,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Shoot from my hand now, love love beam
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.08,0:21:19.79,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Aim for your heart now, love love beam
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.79,0:21:23.63,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Bridging the gap between us
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.63,0:21:25.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}And firing from point blank
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.75,0:21:27.25,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.25,0:21:30.67,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}You won't escape my love love beam
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.67,0:21:34.29,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}To the ends of the Earth, love love beam
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.29,0:21:38.04,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Yeah, love is what changes the world
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.04,0:21:44.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\fad(150,150)\an8\blur3}Dye it all heart-colored, even the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little story is\Nabout a dream Yuuki had.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High school?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:21:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit zoning out first\Nthing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.68,0:22:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, underclassmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lessons are starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to class!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the heck is everyone a student?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your mind, so I'm able\Nto make things like this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop messing with my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I'm combing through your memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you didn't have a girlfriend\Nwhile you were in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.76,0:22:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be your mate, Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can pick up where we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.23,0:23:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's moving on its own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play it cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.56,0:23:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ton of questions\NI still need to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to try and stop this\Nbefore it goes too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.02,0:23:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki cuts class.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.38,0:23:30.04,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Episode 12
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.38,0:23:30.04,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs99}Gods Assemble
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Episode 12, Gods Assemble!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's today's bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We welcome you all to the\NSlave High School! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'll be your mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be thrilling.

